{"availability":"available","full":"itsthisjustin/crosspoint-pxc-converter","name":"crosspoint-pxc-converter","description":"Browser-based image-to-PXC converter for CrossPoint e-reader wallpapers. Supports Floyd-Steinberg, Atkinson, Jarvis, Stucki, Burkes, Bayer and Zhou-Fang dithering. No upload — runs entirely in your browser.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":18,"forks":3,"created":"2026-04-09T18:00:38Z","updated":"2026-10-02T20:41:34Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://crosspoint-pxc-converter.pages.dev","topics":["crosspoint","dithering","e-ink","e-reader","pxc","xteink"],"demo":"https://crosspoint-pxc-converter.pages.dev/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T17:58:07.864Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T17:58:07.864Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T17:58:07.864Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T14:47:12.203Z","stars":18,"forks":3},{"at":"2026-10-09T15:35:13.018Z","stars":18,"forks":3},{"at":"2026-10-10T19:03:28.791Z","stars":18,"forks":3},{"at":"2026-10-16T17:58:07.864Z","stars":18,"forks":3}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A browser-based creator that turns images and Game Boy 2BPP captures into sleep-screen wallpapers for the CrossPoint e-reader firmware running on XTeink devices. Inputs go in as PNG, JPG, WebP, BMP, GIF, .2bpp, .bin, .gb, or GB-Printer .txt logs. The current user-facing export is a native-palette .bmp (4-bit indexed); the PXC encoder remains internal. Every step runs locally in the browser — no upload, no server."],"features":["Drag-and-drop, click-to-browse, or paste from the clipboard (Ctrl+V / Cmd+V).","The loader inspects the file extension and routes automatically:",".png, .jpg, .jpeg, .webp, .bmp, .gif → image mode.",".2bpp, .bin, .gb → Game Boy binary mode.",".txt (or pasted text) → Game Boy Printer log parser."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/itsthisjustin/crosspoint-pxc-converter/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d72f23a9b00a93c6d93a0e4ed9cc284d7d6